(gb)
?prescribed? means prescribed by rules made under this Act;
(gc)
?Schedule? means the Schedule to this Act;
(h)
"Senate" means the Senate of an Institute refereed to in section 13;
(i)
"Society" means the National Institute of Pharmaceutical Education and Research Society, Sector-67, S.A.S. Nagar
(Mohali), District Ropar, Punjab registered under the Societies Registration Act, 1860;
(j)
"Statutes" and "Ordinances" means the Statutes and the Ordinances of an Institute made under this Act.
